class_name Levels
extends RefCounted
# Campaign levels (GDD 2.1, DECISIONS "M4"). Each level is an experiment
# commissioned by the base's research director: a dish (a Worlds config), a
# gene budget, which genes / pages / interventions are open, a goal with a
# time limit, an extra challenge, a prediction to make before release, and
# what is announced in advance (no surprises).
#
#   goal / challenge kinds (LevelRunner evaluates them):
#     zone_count   your organisms inside `zone` (centre, radius) >= n
#     first_in     your first organism reaches `zone` within `seconds`
#     alive_end    your population at the time limit >= n
#     floor_after  your population never drops below n after `from` seconds
#     algae_left   at the end at least `frac` of the starting algae remains
#     cold_lineage at the end at least `frac` of your cells are on lines that
#                  mutated toward the cold (LevelEval.cold_lineage_share)
#     patches      at the end you outnumber `rival` in at least n `patches`
#     patches_all  ... in every patch
#   events: announced world changes (LevelEval.tick_events), e.g. chill
#   temp_fixed: the preferred temperature is locked (designer)
#   predict.metric names the measured value: zone_count / alive_end / first_in
#
# Gene indices: 0 speed 1 sense 2 shell 3 attack 4 fertility 5 metabolism
# 6 neural 7 thermal. Locked genes stay at `fixed` and cannot be changed.

